BaseVault_setDefaultCcipGasLimit
├── when the caller does not have the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
├── when the gas limit is zero
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAmount
└── when the caller has the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
    └── it should set the default CCIP gas limit and emit DefaultCcipGasLimitSet
